From: TDVP Device Team <devices@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] saslutil: include time.h for time and clock declarations

The released config template does not define HAVE_TIME_H. Both standard
functions are used unconditionally in this source, and GCC 14 rejects
their implicit declarations. This changes declarations only.

--- a/lib/saslutil.c
+++ b/lib/saslutil.c
@@ -59,11 +59,9 @@
 #ifdef HAVE_UNISTD_H
 #include <unistd.h>
 #endif
-#ifdef HAVE_TIME_H
 #include <time.h>
-#endif
 #include "saslint.h"
 #include <saslutil.h>
 
